Package: @PKG_NAME@
Version: @PKG_VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: ONNX Runtime @ORT_VERSION@ with MIGraphX @MIGRAPHX_VERSION@ GPU EP (ROCm @ROCM_VERSION@, @GPU_TARGETS@)
 GPU-accelerated ONNX Runtime for AMD Radeon GPUs (@GPU_TARGETS@) with
 ROCm @ROCM_VERSION@ (TheRock amdrocm packages). For darktable's AI
 features and other ONNX workloads.
 .
 Bundles a self-contained, RPATH-hardened stack under /usr/lib/@PKG_NAME@/:
  - libonnxruntime.so.@ORT_VERSION@ (additive C API; GetApi() of any lower
    version works, so clients built against older ORT link fine)
  - libonnxruntime_providers_migraphx.so (MIGraphX execution provider)
  - MIGraphX @MIGRAPHX_VERSION@ with rocMLIR JIT support for @GPU_TARGETS@
  - small test binaries + model under test/ for verification
 .
 Installs cleanly alongside other packages: it shares no files with them.
 The bundled libraries resolve their ROCm dependencies via RPATH; postinst
 additionally registers the missing library directories with ldconfig when
 the ROCm sonames are not yet in the dynamic linker cache (writes
 /etc/ld.so.conf.d/@PKG_NAME@.conf, removed on purge).
